# The paste closes the window: a later Left Alt tap is a plain Alt tap.
# dictation AC-29.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
500 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
350 out sock start 0
500 out sock stop 500
600 in sock paste
600 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
600 out key KEY_INSERT down
600 out key KEY_INSERT up
600 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
600 out sock pasted
800 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
900 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
900 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
900 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
